[00:16.25]We're a thousand miles from comfort,
[00:16.25]安逸与我们相隔万里
[00:20.22]We have traveled land and sea
[00:20.22]我们赤足跋涉千山万水
[00:24.20]But as long as you are with me, there's no place I'd rather be
[00:24.20]只要有你相伴, 我就无处想去
[00:32.72]I would wait forever, exulted in the seam
[00:32.72]愿永远守候着你, 为你每一次露面欣喜
[00:40.50]As long as I am with you, my heart continues to beat
[00:40.50]只要有你相伴, 我的心就小鹿乱撞
[00:48.74]With every step we take, Kyoto to The Bay
[00:48.74]一步步小心翼翼, 京都海湾处歇脚
[00:52.46]Strolling so casually
[00:52.46]步伐随意散漫
[00:56.67]We're different and the same, gave you another name
[00:56.67]我们不同又相似, 取了各自的名字
[01:00.35]Switch up the batteries
[01:00.35]充足能量, 继续前行
[01:04.33]If you gave me a chance I would take it
[01:04.33]你若给我机会, 我会紧紧抓住
[01:08.31]It's a shot in the dark but I'll make it
[01:08.31]茫茫夜色中一抹亮色, 我会尽力出彩
[01:12.24]Know with all of your heart, you can't shame me
[01:12.24]上膛的枪指在她的心脏, 也不能动摇我
[01:16.23]When I am with you, there's no place I rather be
[01:16.23]只要有你相伴，所到之处都是天堂
